@@ -0,0 +1,25 @@
+#!/usr/bin/env bash
+set -uo pipefail
+
+if (( $# < 2 )); then
+  printf 'usage: %s LABEL COMMAND [ARG ...]\n' "$0" >&2
+  exit 64
+fi
+
+label=$1
+shift
+log_dir=$(CDPATH= cd -- "$(dirname -- "$0")" && pwd)
+log_file="$log_dir/$label.log"
+
+{
+  printf 'COMMAND:'
+  printf ' %q' "$@"
+  printf '\n'
+  printf 'WORKDIR: %s\n' "$PWD"
+  printf 'START_UTC: %(%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%SZ)T\n' -1
+  "$@"
+  status=$?
+  printf 'EXIT_STATUS: %d\n' "$status"
+  printf 'END_UTC: %(%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%SZ)T\n' -1
+  exit "$status"
+} >"$log_file" 2>&1

Integrity, fidelity, clean reconstruction, claim adequacy, exhaustive inventory, body sensitivity, and fresh non-vacuity checks are complete. I’m consolidating the trust ledger and verdict in REVIEW.md.
  ✓ Read mandated Kit skill instructions and verify audit-mode trusted mounts
