  ✓ Stage 2: verify program fidelity and run independent differential testing
  ✓ Stage 3: reconstruct definitions cleanly and rerun every positive proof claim
  ✓ Stage 4–5: assess claim adequacy, program pinning, and inventory every semantic/proof rule
  ✓ Stage 6: create and run a fresh false non-vacuity mutation
  → Stage 7: account for proven versus assumed boundaries and write final REVIEW.md
